Short:        Patina desktop layer for UP-Term
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     spotup@gmail.com (spotUP)
Type:         util/misc
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0
Requires:     comm/term/up-term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@
Distribution: Aminet

Patina: the Left Amiga menu and key actions, the app index, the flat Workbench look (icons and window frames),
the notifier and AmTile, with their colour themes and icon sets. Split out of up-term.lha 1.1; the base works without it.

Needs the base archive up-term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes what this archive installed.
